{"publicId":"7b27ca82-5b32-4d22-a721-7a8e1ba68373","title":"SpaceX星舰发射首获在轨整流罩分离成功，助推器现场回收失败","status":"active","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-16T15:59:00.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-16T15:59:00.000Z","digest":"SpaceX于2026年11月16日成功发射Starship火箭，但首次尝试在发射场直接回收超重型助推器失败，而整流罩实现首次在轨分离（MarketWatch 41125）。此次发射包含两项关键测试：1）助推器与星舰组合体在发射后直接降落在发射台附近，但未达预期；2）星舰整流罩首次在轨分离（CNBC 08:36一手报道）。此前四次Starship试射均未完成回收（未注明来源），若回收技术突破，单次发射成本或降至200万美元以下（MarketWatch分析师观点），但CNBC未提供具体成本测算依据。目前官方未公布详细失败原因及后续回收时间节点（MarketWatch）。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-16T18:33:47.395Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"SpaceX 在太空竞赛中扩大领先优势，尽管科技股抛售拖累其股价","latestReport":{"id":"scsq79azfxvppl4luddv51mhm"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":1,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":1,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fQvaGvzA6oko","title":"SpaceX had a mostly successful Starship launch","firstReportAt":"2026-11-16T15:59:00.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"scsq79azfxvppl4luddv51mhm","title":"SpaceX 在太空竞赛中扩大领先优势，尽管科技股抛售拖累其股价","summary":"SpaceX 成功发射 Starship，但亚马逊合作伙伴遭遇挫折。尽管如此，SpaceX 的股价仍受到科技股抛售的影响，市值有所下滑。","source":{"name":"MarketWatch Top Stories","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-16T15:59:00.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"scsq79azfxvppl4luddv51mhm","title":"SpaceX 在太空竞赛中扩大领先优势，尽管科技股抛售拖累其股价","summary":"SpaceX 成功发射 Starship，但亚马逊合作伙伴遭遇挫折。尽管如此，SpaceX 的股价仍受到科技股抛售的影响，市值有所下滑。","source":{"name":"MarketWatch Top Stories","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-16T15:59:00.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-14T00:00:00.000Z","heat":8.1,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-14T01:00:00.000Z","heat":17.8,"participants":2},{"hour":"2026-11-14T07:00:00.000Z","heat":15,"participants":2},{"hour":"2026-11-14T08:00:00.000Z","heat":14.5,"participants":2},{"hour":"2026-11-14T09:00:00.000Z","heat":14.1,"participants":2},{"hour":"2026-11-14T10:00:00.000Z","heat":13.7,"participants":2},{"hour":"2026-11-14T11:00:00.0